- Environment: Python 3.10+, Streamlit, LangChain, Ollama (Local execution only).
- Keep external cloud dependencies at zero cost.
- Do NOT rewrite or delete rules inside `family_db.json`.
- All LLM responses must strictly format travel suggestions around grandparents' mobility, warm weather (>60F), Chinese tour availability, and past visited locations.
- Code style: Modular, clean functions, error handling around local Ollama calls.